  m_Name: clues-house
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PartyGame.Runtime::PartyGame.Core.Content.CluePackData
  id: clues-house
  displayName: The house party
  description: Something went missing while the music was loud
  glyph: HP
  accentIndex: 5
  enabled: 1
  premium: 0
  freshness: 0
  reviewBy: 
  clues:
  - id: c1
    kind: 0
    text: The music stopped, the lights came back on, and the cake was gone.
  - id: c2
    kind: 0
    text: Somebody unplugged the speakers halfway through the night and nobody owned up.
  - id: c3
    kind: 0
    text: The back door was found wide open at two in the morning.
  - id: c4
    kind: 0
    text: Every glass in the kitchen had been moved, and one was missing.
  - id: c5
    kind: 0
    text: The neighbours complained about a noise that nobody in the house remembers making.
  - id: c6
    kind: 0
    text: A coat that belongs to nobody here is hanging in the hallway.
  - id: c7
    kind: 0
    text: There is a handprint on the ceiling and no agreed explanation.
  - id: c8
    kind: 0
    text: The playlist was changed six times in one hour from an unknown device.
  - id: c9
    kind: 1
    text: You were watching the hallway all evening. Exactly one of {a} and {b} is involved.
  - id: c10
    kind: 1
    text: 'Your notes narrow it down: one of {a} and {b} is in on it, the other is not.'
  - id: c11
    kind: 1
    text: You compared stories afterwards. Precisely one of {a} and {b} was lying.
  - id: c12
    kind: 2
    text: You have been watching the room all night, not the dancing. {fact}
  - id: c13
    kind: 2
    text: You were on the stairs with a clear view of everybody. {fact}
  - id: c14
    kind: 2
    text: You kept an eye on who was backing whom. {fact}
  - id: c15
    kind: 3
    text: A note was left on the table. {fact}
  - id: c16
    kind: 3
    text: The neighbour phoned with one detail. {fact}
  - id: c17
    kind: 3
    text: Someone shouted it across the room and everyone heard. {fact}
